index cb0608fbe8f3a32da7fb6e8b2ff44e2a6f3a4971..e81573a701e7c9c9d9734a49b1ca9d58ee9515fb 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -363,6 +363,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- **Registered JSON catalogs follow their Laravel application.** Package catalog navigation, dirty translations, and unsaved locale files use the consuming project. JSON text remains data when a provider changes. Contributed by @thinkycz.
+
 - **Translation diagnostics refresh after catalog edits.** Opening, changing, or discarding an unsaved JSON translation catalog refreshes warnings in unchanged PHP callers. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Keep nested Composer dependencies current.** Unsaved PHP changes in explicitly mapped nested package directories now refresh their consuming projects while sibling projects retain separate state. Contributed by @thinkycz.
